ODC8502 [*] `pylint: disable` comment should be migrated to `# noqa: ODE8102`
  --> pylint_disable_comment_standalone.py:45:1
   |
43 | # A module-level pragma runs to the end of the file in pylint, even though it reads as if
44 | # it only applied to the function below it — so the function after it is covered too.
45 | # pylint: disable=invalid-commit
   | ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^
46 | def module_level(cr):
47 |     cr.commit()
   |
help: Replace with `# noqa: ODE8102`
   |
44 | # it only applied to the function below it — so the function after it is covered too.
   - # pylint: disable=invalid-commit
45 | def module_level(cr):
   -     cr.commit()
46 +     cr.commit()  # noqa: ODE8102
47 |
48 |
49 | def also_covered(cr):
   -     cr.commit()
50 +     cr.commit()  # noqa: ODE8102
   |
note: This is an unsafe fix and may change runtime behavior

